# Advanced QFT and supersymmetry scaffold

Draft research scaffold dated 2026-10-23 for the proposed physics category
`advanced-qft-and-supersymmetry`. This directory contains the integrated
[prose scaffold](scaffold/prose-scaffold.md), the proposed
[machine-readable inventory](scaffold/proposed-inventory.json), and the
noncanonical [plan fragment](scaffold/plan-fragment.json) with a readable
[page-order preview](scaffold/plan-preview.md). The separate discovery index is
[plan-advanced-qft-and-supersymmetry-track.md](../plan-advanced-qft-and-supersymmetry-track.md).
The scoped structural and source-pin findings are recorded in the
[auditor report](audit-report.md).

Specialist research notes:

- [Gauge theory](research-gauge.md): principal-bundle Yang–Mills geometry,
  gauge fixing, BRST/BV, perturbative and nonperturbative boundaries.
- [EFT and experiments](research-eft-experiments.md): EFT models, matching,
  operator spaces, amplitude positivity, SUSY EFT, and empirical fits/searches.
- [Supersymmetry](research-supersymmetry.md): super-Poincare algebra,
  representations, superspace, actions, breaking and phenomenology.
- [Localization and BPS](research-localization-bps.md): equivariant
  localization, S3/S4 formulas, instantons, solitons, BPS indices, wall
  crossing and spectral networks.
- [Symmetries, defects and anomalies](research-symmetries-defects-anomalies.md):
  generalized symmetries, defects, higher structures and anomaly/inflow
  interfaces.
- [Auditor baseline](auditor-baseline.md): read-only reuse/status findings.
- [Recent source leads](recent-source-leads.json): dated metadata and abstract
  discovery scan; it records no full-text review or result acceptance.
- [Owner brief](OWNER-BRIEF.md): task boundary and acceptance context.

The scaffold has a scoped structural and source-pin audit and is ready for
owner-level draft-plan integration. It is not production content, proof
acceptance, publication, or a workflow transition. The active physics run,
