snapshots, existing carriers, and workflow engines remain unchanged. Every
future claim remains draft until its proof, model premise, source review,
empirical analysis, and ordinary workflow reviews are complete. No exhaustive
October 2026 literature search is claimed; the recorded source cutoff is the
