      url: "https://www.math.fau.de/wp-content/uploads/2024/01/bundle-lect.pdf"
      locator: "Chapter 5 §5.4 and Chapter 6 §6.1, printed pp. 92–95 and 100–101: trivial-bundle connection forms and curvature."
