+The remaining assigned items are to be added supplier-first. The batch scheduling record gives batch 2 level 0 with no in-run page prerequisites; all five named page prerequisites are imported mathematical context. The only cross-batch consumer is downstream and belongs to its owning batch; this file will contain only edges whose consumer is owned by batch 2.
