@@ -0,0 +1,114 @@
+---
+id: def-qftx-principal-connection-form
+kind: definition
+title: Principal connection 1-form from a horizontal distribution
+status: draft
+origin: session
+dependency_level: 0
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+category: quantum-field-theory-mathematics
