+The exact imported principal-connection definition supplies a horizontal complement and vertical-valued curvature, not a \(\mathfrak g\)-valued form or Cartan formula. Its declared axiom base carries exactly \(\mathrm{AC}_\omega\). The four proposed contracts also omit the direct Lie-group tangent-algebra theorem needed to identify \(\mathfrak g=T_eG\), and they do not define the graded bracket of Lie-algebra-valued forms. Both are supplied explicitly in the authoring dependency map below; no full Axiom of Choice is introduced.
